*  memory-allocation-2_driver -- loads memory-allocation-2.sno, a file with no END statement, and ends, so the state the file leaves at load time is graded by the termination dump
*  (the grader 2026-11-18; Lon 2026-11-17: a library file with no main is graded by its driver, a silent program by its dump).
-INCLUDE "memory-allocation-2.sno"
END
